td><td>36.4/4.5</td><td>14.3/57.1</td><td>27.7/20.5</td></tr><tr><td>Llama3.1-70B-Instruct Qwen2.5-Coder-32B-Instruct</td><td>7B 32B</td><td>48.9/24.4 71.1/13.3</td><td>43.8/20.0 66.7/15.9</td><td>34.2/26.3 67.4/16.9</td><td>40.4/22.5 74.6/13.6</td><td>54.2/20.3 65.8/18.4</td><td>45.5/9.1 100.0/0.0</td><td>71.4/14.3 63.6/18.2</td><td>44.9/21.0 68.9/15.6</td></tr></table>\n\nTable 3: The win/tie rate of diffrent instruction LLMs on CodeArena. The underlined numbers represent the bes scores within the same model size range.",
